flowchart TD
    SE[Staff Engineer]

    SE --> TL[Tech Lead]
    SE --> AR[Architect]
    SE --> SO[Solver]
    SE --> RH[Right Hand]

    subgraph sg_tl [Tech Lead Focus]
        TL --> TL1[Guide a single team]
        TL --> TL2[Set technical direction]
        TL --> TL3[Unblock engineers daily]
        TL --> TL4[Partner closely<br/>with manager]
    end

    subgraph sg_ar [Architect Focus]
        AR --> AR1[Own cross-team<br/>technical vision]
        AR --> AR2[Define system boundaries]
        AR --> AR3[Drive alignment<br/>across orgs]
        AR --> AR4[Ensure long-term<br/>system health]
    end

    subgraph sg_so [Solver Focus]
        SO --> SO1[Tackle hardest<br/>open problems]
        SO --> SO2[Deep domain expertise]
        SO --> SO3[Move between teams<br/>as needed]
        SO --> SO4[Deliver under<br/>ambiguity]
    end

    subgraph sg_rh [Right Hand Focus]
        RH --> RH1[Extend executive<br/>leadership reach]
        RH --> RH2[Drive org-wide<br/>initiatives]
        RH --> RH3[Handle special<br/>projects]
        RH --> RH4[Bridge strategy<br/>and execution]
    end

